{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mainu</i> is a fast-paced action adventure set inside a mysterious 13-floor mall consumed by energy. When Tonu meets a girl named Venera, he learns that a powerful being named Ormatsu has unknowingly infused his excess magic into ordinary capsule toys\u2014creating living creatures called Mainus. Drawn to the mall\u2019s endless flow of light, food, and movement, Ormatsu spreads through the building like a black hole, splitting himself into thirteen extensions that drain the life of each floor. Tonu\u2019s own force energy allows him to control the awakened Mainus and fight back. Guided by Venera, he must collect, master, and unleash their power to stop Ormatsu before the entire mall\u2014and reality itself\u2014is consumed.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome Aboard!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553610/4141007fb8503522bf5fe2ccc8c206051d1b6c6b.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553610?t=1768898980","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553610?t=1768898980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553610/bb8a79b90e6d368bc1add3b8b27716572dbd2deb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768898980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553610/bb8a79b90e6d368bc1add3b8b27716572dbd2deb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768898980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mainu</i> is a fast-paced action adventure set inside a mysterious 13-floor mall consumed by energy. When Tonu meets a girl named Venera, he learns that a powerful being named Ormatsu has unknowingly infused his excess magic into ordinary capsule toys\u2014creating living creatures called Mainus. Drawn to the mall\u2019s endless flow of light, food, and movement, Ormatsu spreads through the building like a black hole, splitting himself into thirteen extensions that drain the life of each floor. Tonu\u2019s own force energy allows him to control the awakened Mainus and fight back. Guided by Venera, he must collect, master, and unleash their power to stop Ormatsu before the entire mall\u2014and reality itself\u2014is consumed.</p>","developers":["Kanmai"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553610/324ae0fc742f0b9f03b89b032248021389785837/header.jpg?t=1768898980","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Kanmai. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel UHD 600 or better, Apple M1 GPU)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 or Apple M1/M2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU or AMD Radeon Pro 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3553610/429738304/41d876bfe23aadd77b01fc26be54311b17